---

layouts/herdr-t3.json, layouts/herdr-t3.svg, keys.json (in part) and
mods/t3-* come from herdr-t3 (https://github.com/JinJieBeWater/herdr-t3) by
JinJieBeWater, under the Apache License 2.0 (licenses/herdr-t3-APACHE-2.0.txt).
The mods/t3-* folders are unmodified copies of upstream commit
a790cc280cfbc27e856672edb457e3ee4061cd92. layouts/herdr-t3.json and keys.json
were modified as README.md describes ("How it differs from herdr-t3").

mods/files-t3 is a copy of the Files mod that ships with Herdr
(https://herdr.dev), with its corners and outline changed.

Parts of mods/review-pane (scroller.js, zoom.js, paint.js, and the shapes and
base-branch guess in engine.js) come from herdr-gitview
(https://github.com/ChmaraX/herdr-gitview), under this license:

